  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Multiple fragments tear through your neck, ripping apart windpipe and muscle, nicking a carotid artery and damaging your lower jaw. You start choking on blood and torn flesh as even more crimson gushes out in rhythmic spurts through the ragged wounds.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone] and @Condition[Bleeding] (3), the latter of which can only be removed through Surgery. Should you fail to bleed to death you’ll still suffer extensive damage to your voice apparatus, effectively losing use of your tongue (see under Amputated Parts).</p>"
    },
